    "detailed_description": "This VR game is a time machine. You don't get to choose where you go. When you pull the lever, its random.<br><br>You receive a date telling you where you are in time and the doors open. There's no way of predicting where you'll end up.<br><br>You can't leave the time machine - but you can stick your head out, but be warned sometimes you might not want to.<br><br><strong>Where might I end up?</strong><br><br>You might end up somewhere significant or you might end up somewhere totally ordinary. <br><br>If you don't like where you are then you pull the lever again.<br><br>Have fun!<br><br><strong>Controls</strong><br><br>The game takes place in a single 2x3m room. You can use teleport and smooth locomotion to move around in the limited space if you would like to play sitting down. Its best played roomscale.<br><br><strong>This is a VR game but you will optionally be able to play it in first person mode.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "This VR game is a time machine. You don't get to choose where you go. When you pull the lever, its random.<br><br>You receive a date telling you where you are in time and the doors open. There's no way of predicting where you'll end up.<br><br>You can't leave the time machine - but you can stick your head out, but be warned sometimes you might not want to.<br><br><strong>Where might I end up?</strong><br><br>You might end up somewhere significant or you might end up somewhere totally ordinary. <br><br>If you don't like where you are then you pull the lever again.<br><br>Have fun!<br><br><strong>Controls</strong><br><br>The game takes place in a single 2x3m room. You can use teleport and smooth locomotion to move around in the limited space if you would like to play sitting down. Its best played roomscale.<br><br><strong>This is a VR game but you will optionally be able to play it in first person mode.</strong>",
    "short_description": "This 'time machine' takes you where others won't.",
